From 7c3e1b577fa33eb16368005808809a276e7741a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:25:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix CI: run the current learning tests instead of removed
 scripts

check.yml still called scripts/test_learning.py and the old
scripts/test_learning.cjs. Both tested the former learning.json quiz,
which the interactive redesign replaced.

- check.yml: install the updated workflow (was staged as
  scripts/check.workflow.yml); runs check.py, test_learning.cjs,
  strict MkDocs build, check_site.py, plus a browser job that runs
  test_course_browser.cjs against the real browser Linux.
- scripts/test_learning.cjs (from test_checker.cjs): checker unit
  tests, content structure, and every example, model solution,
  alternative solution and wrong attempt executed in a real shell.
- scripts/learning_cases.cjs: test cases shared by both tests.
- Remove scripts/test_shell_browser.cjs (tested the old chapter 5
  prototype UI); its offline check moved to test_course_browser.cjs.
- README, VERIFICATION: updated test names and results.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D1R9bPCbMqaJEasT2yq7P3
